Conflicts: xfwm4
Replaces: xfwm4
Description: Xfce window manager with OpenGL compositing
 This fork of xfwm4 adds an OpenGL compositor with automatic XRender
 fallback. It retains the original executable names, settings channel,
 themes and session integration, and replaces the distribution xfwm4 package.
